      "calibrated": false,
      "note": "PANLOAD_SIMPLE/PANLOAD_VARIABLE were NOT used: both declare an RPAN parameter that is never referenced in the subckt body (dead code -- verified by reading the model). PANLOAD_TRANSFORMER is used instead (real mutual-inductance K_couple + a used R_pan), at the cost of needing a secondary inductance L2 that pan_load.sub does not document per material (left at its own default, 1uH)."
    }
